IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT domain
IMPORT `g1-first-schedule`
IMPORT `g1-licensing-duty`
IMPORT `g3-licensee-duties`
IMPORT `g3-operator`
IMPORT `g5-inspectors`

-- ind-c-tests-routes.l4: independent tests (ind-c) of the ROUTES into the Third Schedule: which item, if any, a set
-- of facts reaches.  The Third Schedule is in my scope; the functions that pick the item belong to G1 (s.3(a)),
-- G3 (ss.13, 18(a)) and G5 (s.31(2)), so these tests call those groups' interfaces (IP9/IP10).
-- Scenario ids A8, A9, A12, A13, A14 of work/ind-c/expectations.md (gazette p. 205).

§ `ind-c: routes into the Third Schedule`

§§ `Fixtures`

GIVEN kw IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Cooling system`
`a system of kW` kw MEANS
    `Cooling system` WITH `cooling capacity in kilowatts` IS kw
                        , `refrigerants` IS LIST (Refrigerant WITH `designation` IS "410A", `use of the refrigerant is permitted by law` IS TRUE)

GIVEN system IS A `Cooling system`
      kinds IS A LIST OF `Licence kind`
GIVETH A `Circumstances of work under section 3(a)`
`leak repair on` system `by a holder of` kinds MEANS
    `Circumstances of work under section 3(a)` WITH
        `the cooling system worked on` IS system
        `the activity the act amounts to` IS JUST `B.1(4) checking or repairing refrigerant leaks`
        `the limits of the item` IS `Facts about an act for the limits of First Schedule items` WITH
                                      `the parts connected are integral control and monitoring accessories only` IS TRUE
                                    , `the electrical work is done in the integral electrical system only` IS TRUE
        `licence kinds in force on the day` IS kinds
        `a licence of the person is not in force` IS FALSE
        `the Law has commenced for the work on the system` IS TRUE
        `the system is of a class exempted by an order under section 3(b)` IS FALSE
        `the licensee breached a licence condition` IS FALSE
        `the licensee is restricted from the work` IS FALSE
        `a provision under the Law was breached by the work` IS FALSE

`ind-c licensee` MEANS Person WITH `reference for the person` IS "ind-1", `kind of person` IS `an individual`

GIVEN job IS A `Job kind`
GIVETH A `Work item`
`a job on 12 kW on 2027-06-01 of kind` job MEANS
    `Work item` WITH `performed by` IS `ind-c licensee`
                   , `the kind of job` IS job
                   , `the system` IS `a system of kW` 12
                   , `date performed` IS YMD 2027 6 1

GIVEN tightness IS A BOOLEAN
      part5 IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A LIST OF `Wording of Israeli Standard 994`
`the Standard, the tightness test done:` tightness `part 5 kept:` part5 MEANS
    LIST (`Wording of Israeli Standard 994` WITH `the day this wording took effect` IS YMD 2020 1 1
                                             , `the work conformed to part 4 of this wording` IS tightness
                                             , `a tightness test of the refrigerant piping was performed as the testing chapter of part 4 of this wording requires` IS tightness
                                             , `the work conformed to part 5 of this wording` IS part5)

`a regular engager` MEANS `Facts about a person who engages others in work on cooling systems` WITH
    `engages another person on a regular basis to perform work on cooling systems` IS TRUE
    `owns or manages a business that offers the performance of work on cooling systems to the public` IS TRUE

`a lawful inspector` MEANS `An inspector at work` WITH
    `authorised by the Minister as an inspector under section 30(a)` IS TRUE
    `powers conferred by the authorisation` IS LIST `require name, address and identification`, `require information or a document`
    `acting to supervise the implementation of the Law` IS TRUE
    `performing his function` IS TRUE
    `visibly wearing a badge` IS TRUE
    `the badge identifies him and his function` IS TRUE
    `holding a certificate signed by the Minister` IS TRUE
    `the certificate states his function and his powers as an inspector` IS TRUE
    `the certificate was demanded` IS FALSE
    `the certificate was shown on demand` IS FALSE
    `the Law has commenced for the work on the system being supervised` IS TRUE

GIVEN thing IS A `Thing an inspector demands under section 31(2)`
GIVETH A `Demand under section 31(2)`
`a demand for` thing MEANS
    `Demand under section 31(2)` WITH `the inspector demanded it` IS TRUE
                                    , `the thing demanded` IS thing
                                    , `the person from whom it was demanded is concerned in the matter` IS TRUE
                                    , `it secures or eases the implementation of the provisions of the Law` IS TRUE

§§ `A12, A13: s 3(a), items (1) and (2)`

-- A12: a grade 1 holder (up to 18 kW) repairs a leak on a 50 kW system: item (2).
#ASSERT `the listed violation committed under section 3(a)` (`leak repair on` (`a system of kW` 50) `by a holder of` (LIST `grade 1 licence`)) EQUALS JUST `work without a licence of the kind appropriate to the system`
-- A13: no licence at all: item (1).
#ASSERT `the listed violation committed under section 3(a)` (`leak repair on` (`a system of kW` 50) `by a holder of` EMPTY) EQUALS JUST `work with no licence at all`
-- A grade 3 holder on the same system: no item.
#ASSERT `the listed violation committed under section 3(a)` (`leak repair on` (`a system of kW` 50) `by a holder of` (LIST `grade 3 licence`)) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `A8: s 13, only the skipped tightness test on an installation is item (4)`

-- An installation without the tightness test of part 4: item (4).
#ASSERT `s.13 — the listed violation committed under section 13` (`a job on 12 kW on 2027-06-01 of kind` `an installation job`) (`the Standard, the tightness test done:` FALSE `part 5 kept:` TRUE) TRUE (LIST `grade 1 licence`) TRUE EQUALS JUST `installation without the tightness test of the piping`
-- A8: maintenance not in accordance with part 5 breaches s.13 but is priced by no item: nothing.
#ASSERT `s.13 — the listed violation committed under section 13` (`a job on 12 kW on 2027-06-01 of kind` `a maintenance job`) (`the Standard, the tightness test done:` TRUE `part 5 kept:` FALSE) TRUE (LIST `grade 1 licence`) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- An installation with the tightness test done but part 5 not kept: no item either.
#ASSERT `s.13 — the listed violation committed under section 13` (`a job on 12 kW on 2027-06-01 of kind` `an installation job`) (`the Standard, the tightness test done:` TRUE `part 5 kept:` FALSE) TRUE (LIST `grade 1 licence`) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `A14: s 18(a), items (5) and (6)`

-- An operator engages a grade 2 holder on a 75 kW system (only grade 3 covers it): item (6).
#ASSERT `s.18(a) — the listed violation committed under section 18(a)` `a regular engager` TRUE TRUE (LIST `grade 2 licence`) (LIST `grade 3 licence`) EQUALS JUST `engaging a person without a licence of the appropriate kind`
-- Engages a person with no licence at all: item (5).
#ASSERT `s.18(a) — the listed violation committed under section 18(a)` `a regular engager` TRUE TRUE EMPTY (LIST `grade 3 licence`) EQUALS JUST `engaging a person who had no licence at all`
-- Engages a grade 3 holder: no item.
#ASSERT `s.18(a) — the listed violation committed under section 18(a)` `a regular engager` TRUE TRUE (LIST `grade 3 licence`) (LIST `grade 3 licence`) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `A9: s 31(2), item (7) is a DOCUMENT only`

`ind-c a person` MEANS Person WITH `reference for the person` IS "p-7", `kind of person` IS `a corporation`

-- A document lawfully demanded and not given: item (7).
#ASSERT isJust (`the violation committed under s.31(2), if any` `a lawful inspector` (`a demand for` `a document that is not computer output`) `ind-c a person` "act-7" (YMD 2027 6 1) TRUE)
-- A9: information (not a document) demanded and not given: no item.
#ASSERT isNothing (`the violation committed under s.31(2), if any` `a lawful inspector` (`a demand for` `information that is not in a document`) `ind-c a person` "act-7" (YMD 2027 6 1) TRUE)
